{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"18e3b7e2b6dc758461ad92bb2e22eaa6d37f19232edbeec60d1f11872dff219e","ja":"運命のボタン","zh":"命运之按钮","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0cc0b8a7a436e00afe860d28246f63b812e14dac90d615dce0947f15faa7c239","ja":"はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……そ、それで私たち、\n何問正解したんでしょうか！？","zh":"哈、哈、哈……那、那我们\n到底答对了几道题呢！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"37bf86b46f550748686a7e6d5bf420c10e5a8c0355622d58a07e1c0bd99c59dc","ja":"「正解数は……お見事、ぴったり15問正解です！\n『賞品ゲットチャレンジ』、挑戦権獲得！」","zh":"“答对的题数是……太精彩了，刚好答对了15题！\n恭喜获得‘奖品赢取挑战’的挑战资格！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3df2f3f2c21787830c408d15db59436f431ea5385374f93d4d68f7cbd394f23d","ja":"やったーーーっ♪","zh":"太好啦——♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d33b9b959eb960f3112e5a7c0b83a79c02255682a39adb4102651db28eccd403","ja":"「今から、赤いボタンと青いボタンが登場するので、\nどちらか片方だけ、押してもらいます」","zh":"“接下来会出现红色按钮和蓝色按钮，\n请大家只按下其中一个”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0ebd2fcd56985a81ece177a33cfb8da7e7055114f6280e00ed028bcf29f9200a","ja":"「当たれば高級スイーツビュッフェ！　外れるか\n時間内に選べなければ、過酷な崖登りにご招待です！」","zh":"“猜中就能享受高级甜品自助餐！要是猜错，\n或者没能在时间内选好，就会被邀请去残酷的攀崖之旅哦！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"558489e8267acf878c516b54d3678efcedf31bbdf11e5ea5e681911204e30055","ja":"番組の予習をした時も思ったけど、なんて極端な……。\nそんなの選べないよ～……。","zh":"预习节目的时候我就在想了，这也太极端了吧……。\n那种选择根本选不出来啦～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"40fcb6547fb72c75c39862ff58c4e1dc8aaa74dbc4cfb067d1784256ba4661da","ja":"崖登りかぁ……罰ゲームも面白そうだけど、\nやっぱり、高級スイーツビュッフェに行きたいよね～♪","zh":"爬悬崖啊……惩罚游戏感觉也挺有意思的，\n不过果然还是更想去高级甜点自助餐呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"13974b73e1e2e15368db127b538c6567f0bed0408bf4676eea3913580d54f275","ja":"もちろん！　せっかくここまで頑張ったんだし。\nでも、赤と青、どっちを押したらいいんだろう……。","zh":"当然了！毕竟都努力走到这一步了。\n不过，红色和蓝色，到底该按哪一个才好呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"23938dfa33a40c43c635450214a5346d03215a41bd0c466b9d663d64afea9ddb","ja":"前回の放送は、たしか青だったから赤……。\nで、でも、同じ色が続くことも……うーん……。","zh":"上次播出我记得是蓝色，所以这次选红色……\n可、可是也有可能连续是同一种颜色……唔……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1396ee92f2a361f75f95c677094a3024b86513e92fb47904d2a98ebc0dc007f6","ja":"「それでは、『賞品ゲットチャレンジ』です！」","zh":"“那么，接下来是‘奖品获取挑战’！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"090b18b5457068b5edbcc61de1c00352172b0ddf32ff658b06216b556923b736","ja":"うーん……うーん……。","zh":"唔——……唔——……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"96a3474e1db62cc0b80e9231fc8504251735a1f53bd1b60efdd10197867bacf5","ja":"あっ、ボタンが出てきた♪","zh":"啊，按钮出来了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"95baf5cff2d1b39561256c837c1e952093a048fcfa1313027b3c3fe3dc2ff3dc","ja":"ポチッ！","zh":"按！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"779520e30ce4ccc7d546de029ad35920f849e10542d5c198e81e4ddc974ad6f8","ja":"………………えっ！？","zh":"………………诶！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6ed7e2904fd81d39cf8ad60bebd5e9ba12a85b777fd7a1411c47b8368a1f1faa","ja":"ピンポンピンポンピンポーン♪\n「おめでとうございます！　大当たり～！」","zh":"叮咚叮咚叮——咚♪\n“恭喜！中大奖啦～！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b71f8502332f1167ae6002017ec904c330a6d2647ddc94350935bc31a7fcf287","ja":"や、やった……。未来、ありがとう！\nでも、どうして赤のボタンを選んだの？","zh":"太、太好了……未来，谢谢你！\n不过，你为什么会选红色的按钮呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"133c531d9f808d9e3d36e646bbf5cfb62faf36faa3a9329abb95c3bd0dbde0cc","ja":"ボタンを見たら押したくなっちゃって、\n近くにあった方を押したんだ。でへへ～♪","zh":"一看到按钮就忍不住想按，\n于是按了离得比较近的那个。嘿嘿～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1635.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f3322cf9a599ed704dd0cc2edc7c9603e74b412411a4ae03d373d8e247c3bea6","ja":"そ、そんな適当な理由で……？　で、でも、\n正解の方を選べたんだし、良かった♪","zh":"就、就因为这么随便的理由……？不、不过，\n既然选对了答案，那就太好了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
